<assessmentItem xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqti_v2p1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqti_v2p1 http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/qti/qtiv2p1/imsqti_v2p1p1.xsd" identifier="VE_IP_63" title="Question 63" adaptive="false" timeDependent="false"><responseDeclaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" baseType="identifier"><correctResponse><value>c</value></correctResponse></responseDeclaration><outcomeDeclaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" baseType="float" normalMaximum="1" normalMinimum="0"><defaultValue><value>0</value></defaultValue></outcomeDeclaration><itemBody><div><p>Which statement replaces XXX to complete the C++ Graph class's AddDirectedEdge() member function?</p><p><code><div class="highlight"><pre><span /><span class="n">Edge</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">AddDirectedEdge</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Vertex</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">fromVertex</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Vertex</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">toVertex</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">double</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">weight</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mf">1.0</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="k">if</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">HasEdge</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">fromVertex</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">toVertex</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span>
<span class="w">      </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">nullptr</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="p">}</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="n">Edge</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">newEdge</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Edge</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">fromVertex</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">toVertex</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">weight</span><span class="p">);</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="n">fromEdges</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">fromVertex</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="n">push_back</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">newEdge</span><span class="p">);</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="n">XXX</span>
<span class="w">   </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">newEdge</span><span class="p">;</span>
